{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>The meaning of Nephilim.</b> (שיפיל) (that he would cause to fall) — the heart of whoever sees them falls, out of amazement at their towering height." "And the sense of \"after that\" is: after the Flood. And behold, the sons of Anak were initially of the family of the sons of the Elohim:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:36.191227002Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}